that we have underway here at the National Library&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:20.100
of Medicine this special program referred to as&nbsp;
an r25 training program introduces promising young&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:25.440
scholars undergraduates and graduate students&nbsp;
to the field of biomedical informatics and data&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:30.300
science biomedical informatics and data&nbsp;
science is the fundamental core of how we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.880
will discover Truth for health over the next&nbsp;
50 years the goal of the National Library of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:42.420
medicine's R-25 program is to support educational&nbsp;
activities that encourage talented undergraduate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:47.220
and master students including those from&nbsp;
groups underrepresented in the biomedical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:53.040
Behavioral Sciences to pursue further training and&nbsp;
careers in biomedical informatics and data science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:59.580
I am most excited to see this Innovative program&nbsp;
launched at the National Library of Medicine it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:08.640
frankly the most exciting thing I've seen&nbsp;
in the last five years [Applause] [Music]&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.620
thank you

